<title>AUSTRIA: LUGE-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP TEAM COMPETITION RESULTS.</title>
<headline>LUGE-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP TEAM COMPETITION RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>IGLS, Austria 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Official results of the</p>
<p>team competition at the luge world championships on Friday:</p>
<p>1. Austria 145 points - gold medal</p>
<p>2. Germany 139 - silver medal</p>
<p>3. Italy 124 - bronze medal</p>
<p>4. U.S. 122</p>
<p>5. Russia 83</p>
<p>6. Sweden/Norway 77</p>
<p>7. Latvia 70</p>
<p>8. equal. Japan 69</p>
<p>equal. Ukraine 69</p>
<p>10. Slovakia 54</p>
<p>11. Canada 52</p>
<p>12. New Zealand/Belgium (joint team) 41</p>
<p>13. Czech Republic 30</p>
<p>14. Britain/Virgin Islands (joint team)24</p>
<p>15. Estonia 22</p>
<p>16. Liechtenstein/Australia (joint team) 17</p>
<p>17. Romania/Bermudas (joint team) 9</p>
<p>18. Tapei/Greece  (joint team) 6</p>
</text>
